d\">L</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> is the linear map of (a); so\nstandard errors of pairwise contrasts do not depend on which baseline\nwas used.</p></li>\n</ol>\n</div>","file":"ch36-multinomial-ordinal/01-baseline-category-logits.html"}